{"last_link_id": 26, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#444466", "widgets_values": ["图生图新海诚风格转换工作流（原创）\nKrea2 Turbo + Joy Caption反推 + sunsetblur风格LoRA\n\n功能：\n  上传任意图片 → Joy Caption自动反推提示词 → 注入新海诚风格关键词\n  → Krea2 Turbo + sunsetblur LoRA 重绘 → 输出风格化插画\n\nKrea2 是 DiT 架构模型，与 SDXL 加载方式不同：\n  - UNETLoader 加载扩散模型 → models/diffusion_models/\n  - CLIPLoader 加载Qwen3VL文本编码器 → models/text_encoders/\n  - VAELoader 加载Qwen Image VAE → models/vae/\n\n使用方法：\n  1. 在「上传图片」节点加载要转换的图片\n  2. Joy Caption 会自动反推提示词（可手动修改反推结果）\n  3. 风格前缀已预设新海诚关键词，可自行调整\n  4. 调节 denoise 控制风格转换强度：\n     0.3 = 保留原图，仅加风格滤镜\n     0.55 = 平衡（推荐）\n     0.75 = 大幅重绘，仅保留构图\n  5. Krea2 Turbo 仅需 8 步即可出图，速度极快\n\n所需插件：\n  - Comfyui_CXH_joy_caption（Joy Caption反推）\n  - ComfyUI-KJNodes（字符串拼接）\n  - ComfyUI-TTP（提示词拼接）\n  - pysssss（文本预览）"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#333344", "size": [720, 240], "pos": [20, 10], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "JoyPipeline", "slot_index": 0, "links": [7], "label": "JoyCaption", "type": "JoyPipeline", "localized_name": "JoyPipeline"}], "color": "#664466", "widgets_values": ["unsloth/Meta-Llama-3.1-8B-bnb-4bit"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "模型"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Joy_caption_load", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#553355", "size": [400, 80], "pos": [20, 650], "id": 3, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Joy_caption_load"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [8, 9], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#664466", "widgets_values": ["A descriptive caption for this image", 1024, 0.7, false], "inputs": [{"name": "joy_pipeline", "link": 7, "label": "JoyCaption", "type": "JoyPipeline", "localized_name": "joy_pipeline"}, {"name": "image", "link": 5, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "